                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka i kitipa pa jom'oyeyo, Were oketh'iye: Marapena jomoor, mar'ario jotuci wac Were, mar'adek jofonji, to luwo joma timo gir'aura, to luwo joma nigi meni ma botho two, kodi joma konyo jowoti gin, aka joman jodhum, kodi joma luwo dhodhok m'opokere opokere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiparo ni ji je jobedo jomoor? Kosa jotuci wac Were? Kosa jofonji? Dhano je nigi meni ma timo gir'aura? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosa botho two? Kosa luwo dhodhok m'opokere? Kosa tito dwoŋ dhodhok no? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
